The =3DofFA is optional, but the candles are required.  You have a
couple of options:

1. Break wishless conduct, and wish for the candles.
2. Break polyless conduct.  Polypile any remaining tools (such as the
many chests in the valley of the dead).  Be warned that this could
fail.

If you want to keep both conducts, it is hard, but not impossible.
But be warned, this will be a time-consuming ordeal. First, you can
repeatedly create monsters and kill them, and hopefully one of them
will drop the candles you need.  Or, you can pudding farm.


